{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2021-07-29 11:54:00', 'title': 'DISH ADDS HBO MAX, HBO AND CINEMAX, BRINGS MORE CONTENT TO VIEWERS NATIONWIDE', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO., JULY 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DISH NETWORK ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE POPULAR HBO MAX STREAMING PLATFORM, AS WELL AS THE HBO AND CINEMAX PREMIUM NETWORKS ARE NOW AVAILABLE TO DISH TV CUSTOMERS NATIONWIDE THROUGH A NEW AGREEMENT WITH WARNERMEDIA.'}